    "title": "pandas.Period.daysinmonth — pandas 3.1.0.dev0 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.Period.daysinmonth#\n\n- Period.daysinmonth#\n- Get the total number of days of the month that this period falls on. Deprecated since version 3.1.0: Use `Period.days_in_month` instead.\n  - Returns:\n    - int\n See also \n  - `Period.days_in_month`\n  - Return the days of the month.\n  - `Period.day_of_year`\n  - Return the day of the year.\n Examples >>> p = pd.Period(\"2018-03-11\", freq='h') >>> p.days_in_month 31",
